604
00:36:55.429 --> 00:37:00.667
Mother belonged to the school board . . . I mean you know to the . . .

605
00:37:00.667 --> 00:37:02.413
<v C. GORDWIN>[whispers] PTA [Parent-Teacher Association].

606
00:37:02.413 --> 00:37:10.270
<v GORDWIN>PTA and she always acted . . . did things like in the community and worked with the teachers at school.

607
00:37:10.270 --> 00:37:12.452
One of my aunts [Edder?].

608
00:37:12.452 --> 00:37:19.000
My mother's sister, Edder, she worked . . . Her and Mother worked with things at school.

609
00:37:19.000 --> 00:37:21.042
<v MCKEE>Say her whole name Mama.

610
00:37:21.042 --> 00:37:21.858
<v GORDWIN>Edder Towner.

611
00:37:21.858 --> 00:37:25.533
But which Aunt Edder had been married three times.

612
00:37:25.533 --> 00:37:31.250
All, she had two husbands that died and her last husband was a Jones.

613
00:37:31.250 --> 00:37:35.742
<v CRAMER>One of your relatives was a nurse during World War Two.

614
00:37:35.742 --> 00:37:36.150
<v GORDWIN>Yes.

615
00:37:36.150 --> 00:37:40.233
<v CRAMER>One of your . . . Was it one of your aunts, or . . .?

616
00:37:40.233 --> 00:37:42.275
<v GORDWIN>It was my daddy's cousin.

617
00:37:42.275 --> 00:37:42.683
<v CRAMER>Okay.

618
00:37:42.683 --> 00:37:44.317
What was her name?

619
00:37:44.317 --> 00:37:45.133
<v GORDWIN>Agnes Evans.

620
00:37:45.133 --> 00:37:47.992
She wasn't . . . She was the nurse, yes.

621
00:37:47.992 --> 00:37:54.525
She would give the vaccinations and stuff out here when I met her; first met her.

622
00:37:54.525 --> 00:37:59.017
Then they would come and visit Mother and Daddy out here.

623
00:37:59.017 --> 00:38:04.733
<v MCKEE>Did you tell her about the school before they built the high school Mama?

