00:38:04.733 --> 00:38:08.000
<v GORDWIN>Well I'm trying to get to it.

625
00:38:08.000 --> 00:38:08.985
<v CRAMER>We’ll . . . get there.

626
00:38:08.985 --> 00:38:10.299
<v C. GORDWIN>They're doing separate interviews.

627
00:38:10.299 --> 00:38:15.881
<v CRAMER>Yes we've got a lot of time to . . . Or hopefully we've got a lot of time to

