00:38:15.881 --> 00:38:16.537
<c.p>kind of . . .

629
00:38:16.537 --> 00:38:16.866
<v GORDWIN>Yes.

630
00:38:16.866 --> 00:38:19.164
<v CRAMER>Go back as far as we can.

631
00:38:19.164 --> 00:38:19.493
Now . . .

632
00:38:19.493 --> 00:38:19.821
<v GORDWIN>Now . . .

633
00:38:19.821 --> 00:38:25.403
<v CRAMER>I wanted to get your . . . Did Agnes tell any stories about her time in World War Two?

