00:38:26.716 --> 00:38:27.045
<v CRAMER>Okay.

636
00:38:27.045 --> 00:38:27.701
Just curious.

637
00:38:27.701 --> 00:38:30.000
<v GORDWIN>She was always a well-disciplined lady.

638
00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:30.378
<v CRAMER>Yes.

639
00:38:30.378 --> 00:38:30.757
<v GORDWIN>Well-disciplined.

640
00:38:30.757 --> 00:38:32.270
