00:38:56.692 --> 00:39:03.038
Like who were some of your favorite subjects that you . . . when you were growing up?

651
00:39:03.038 --> 00:39:03.885
<v GORDWIN>Like history.

652
00:39:03.885 --> 00:39:04.308
<v CRAMER>History.

653
00:39:04.308 --> 00:39:05.154
That's important.

654
00:39:05.154 --> 00:39:09.808
Who were some of the . . . As far as the teachers go,

655
