1664
01:28:19.212 --> 01:28:20.424
You really think that . . .

1665
01:28:20.424 --> 01:28:21.030
<v GORDWIN>Oh yeah.

1666
01:28:21.030 --> 01:28:21.939
<v C. GORDWIN>There's some suspicions.

1667
01:28:21.939 --> 01:28:23.455
Okay tell her about your . . .

