1717
01:29:52.091 --> 01:29:52.386
<v CRAMER>Okay.

1718
01:29:52.386 --> 01:29:52.682
<v GORDWIN>Music.

1719
01:29:52.682 --> 01:29:52.977
<v CRAMER>Okay.

1720
01:29:52.977 --> 01:29:55.045
<v GORDWIN>Victrola, old time . . . Put your nickel in.

1721
01:29:55.045 --> 01:29:57.409
<v MCKEE>And you’d go and buy your ice cream.

1722
01:29:57.409 --> 01:29:58.000
<v CRAMER>Okay.

1723
01:29:58.000 --> 01:29:58.900
<v GORDWIN>You can dance.

1724
01:29:58.900 --> 01:29:59.200
<v CRAMER>Okay.

1725
