1756
01:30:40.000 --> 01:30:43.421
<v GORDWIN>It was a nice little . . . like a sharp shooter house.

1757
01:30:43.421 --> 01:30:44.447
I can remember.

1758
01:30:44.447 --> 01:30:44.789
<v CRAMER>Okay.

1759
01:30:44.789 --> 01:30:46.842
<v GORDWIN>But it was nice and neat.

1760
01:30:46.842 --> 01:30:49.237
It wasn't raggedy or anything like that.

1761
01:30:49.237 --> 01:30:50.947
<v MCKEE>Leroy might have some pictures.

1762
01:30:50.947 --> 01:30:51.632
<v GORDWIN>Of it.

1763
01:30:51.632 --> 01:30:53.000
I don't know.

1764
01:30:53.000 --> 01:30:53.346
<v CRAMER>Okay.

1765
